WEBVTT

00:15.000 --> 00:18.933
Drink the medicine the military doctor prescribed it for pain.

00:22.600 --> 00:25.640
One more sip I don't want it.

00:28.080 --> 00:31.080
How did it come to be you lying here?

00:32.520 --> 00:38.240
I heard you grabbed a horse in the palace and rushed out the people below.

00:38.320 --> 00:44.027
Couldn't stop you it's only been a few days and you rushed here in such a hurry.

00:44.400 --> 00:45.800
So worried about me.

00:46.720 --> 00:51.760
Your servant heard Your Majesty was hit by an arrow that's why I was so anxious.

00:53.880 --> 00:57.027
When Your Majesty is safe the state will be safe.

